      "observed": "The netlist contains two distinct net entries with the same net name `/NET0089`. One entry connects the e-stop buffer/control nodes R19, R21, R35, U17 `/OE`, and U49 `Y`; the other entry connects USB data nodes R81 pin 2 and U34 pin 11 (`USBDP`).",
      "expected": "These should be separate nets. The SPICE deck shows the e-stop/control resistor and buffer nodes on `/NET0070` (for example, `R19 +3V3 /NET0070 10k`) while the USB data resistor/U34 node is on `/NET0089` (`R81 NET0120 /NET0089 27`).",
