        {"source": "netlist", "quote": "(net (code \"25\") (name \"/NET0089\") ... (node (ref \"R81\") (pin \"2\") ...) (node (ref \"U34\") (pin \"11\") (pinfunction \"USBDP\") ...))"},
        {"source": "spice", "quote": "R19 +3V3 /NET0070 10k"},
        {"source": "spice", "quote": "R81 NET0120 /NET0089 27"}
      ],
      "impact": "If the netlist is interpreted as authoritative connectivity, the e-stop control/output node is shorted to the FT231 USB DP line. This would corrupt or disable USB serial data and make the e-stop buffer behavior depend on USB traffic, a clear deviation from the intended separate e-stop and USB paths.",
      "confidence": 0.78
    }
  ],
  "summary": "An anomaly is detected: the netlist duplicates the net name `/NET0089`, effectively bridging the e-stop control/output network to the USB DP data network, which contradicts the SPICE deck and the intended separate e-stop/USB connectivity."
}

